{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Exempt 18\u201321-year-olds from Inheritance Tax when used for home or education",
        "additional_details": "We call on the Government to exempt 18-21-year-olds from paying inheritance tax on funds they inherit, provided that these inherited funds are transferred straight into an ISA or LISA to pay towards first homes, higher education, trade training, etc.",
        "background": "Inheritance left to 18\u201321-year-olds face up to 40%, which can strip away vital financial support upon entering adulthood. ",
